[I] The settings application for the COSMIC desktop environment

[T] COSMIC Settings is the settings application of System76's COSMIC desktop
[T] environment, written in Rust with libcosmic. It provides pages for
[T] appearance, displays, input devices, networking, sound, power, users,
[T] region and other desktop and system settings.

[U] https://github.com/pop-os/cosmic-settings/

